                                "sense_id": "b579f109-5732-37b6-bffc-8f7a95f6b6b7",
                                "text": "Content creators (or ‘modders’) are individuals who create additional content for computer games. […] The creation of 3D models requires a lot of skill, with modders needing to have knowledge of 3D design software and coding so that the models can function within the game itself."
                            }
                        ]
